TrackMe 1.8.1

• The map stays where you put it. Pan or zoom while recording and it no longer drags you back.

• Tap any rider in your group to see them on the map, with a short trail showing their heading.

• Walks and runs now report pace, with a bar per kilometre.

• The map matches your theme, and you can pause or finish a ride from the notification.

• Long rides save in one piece, and deleting one clears every part of it.
